('d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000041', 'Technical', 'Data Structures', 'Trees', 'MEDIUM', 'In a Binary Search Tree (BST), which traversal order outputs the elements in strictly sorted ascending order?', 'Pre-order Traversal', 'In-order Traversal', 'Post-order Traversal', 'Level-order Traversal', 1, 'In-order traversal visits (Left, Root, Right), which outputs binary search tree keys in sorted ascending order.'),
